    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d663">

                <pb facs="0901" n="802" xml:id="pg802"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.1731/165a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lane</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-02-26T17:00:00-05:00">February 26, 1936—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Schedule I has not yet been received. Cable when you mailed and when due
                    here.</p>
                <p>Interdepartmental committees considering Schedule II today and we hope to be able
                    to give you final answer on this late this afternoon or tomorrow morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
